  <!-- ================= CALL TO ACTION SECTION ================= -->
  <section class="relative bg-[#2e6bb5] text-white overflow-hidden" data-aos="fade-in" data-aos-duration="1000">
    <div 
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center md:bg-right"
      style="background-image: url('/images/Frame 20561.png');"
    ></div>

    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#205fa6] via-[#205fa6]/90 to-transparent md:via-[#205fa6]/70"></div>

    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10 py-16 md:py-24 lg:py-28 flex items-center">
      <div class="w-full md:w-3/5 lg:w-1/2" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-medium leading-tight text-white tracking-wide">
          Be the Reason Someone<br />Finds Hope Today
        </h2>

        <p class="font-lato mt-5 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#D9ECFB] max-w-xl">
          Join us in upholding Christian values and creating a compassionate and inclusive society. Together, we can provide care, support, and empowerment to destitute individuals, elderly persons, people with intellectual disabilities, and orphans. Your support will help ensure that every individual lives with dignity, respect, and access to essential resources, fostering a world where well-being and happiness are accessible to all.
        </p>

        <div class="font-lato mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <a 
            href="#" 
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-navy text-white px-8 py-3 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-sky hover:text-navy transition-all duration-300 shadow-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white"
          >
            Donate Now
          </a>

          <a 
            href="#" 
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-navy/80 bg-navy/20 text-navy px-7 py-3 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-navy hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-navy"
          >
            Become a Member
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= TESTIMONIALS SLIDER SECTION ================= -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white overflow-hidden" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="900">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10">

      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-12">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[40px] font-medium text-navy tracking-wide uppercase">
            Thousands of Users Talk About Us !
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-600 font-medium italic">
            Real stories from real people making a difference through skill swapping
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 shrink-0">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button id="sliderPrev" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-navy/30 flex items-center justify-center text-navy hover:bg-navy hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-label="Previous">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" /></svg>
            </button>
            <button id="sliderNext" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-navy/30 flex items-center justify-center text-navy hover:bg-navy hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-label="Next">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
            </button>
          </div>
          <a href="#" class="font-lato inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-navy text-navy px-8 py-2 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-navy hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">
            View All
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Swiper Slider Container -->
      <div class="swiper testimonialSwiper pb-12">
        <div class="swiper-wrapper font-lato">

          <!-- Slide 1 -->
          <div class="swiper-slide">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
              <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-[0_4px_25px_rgba(0,0,0,0.07)] overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between border border-gray-100">
                <div class="p-7 sm:p-9"><p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">The love and care I received during difficult times brought me comfort and peace. Guardian Angel became a family when I needed one most.</p></div>
                <div class="bg-[#76B2E1] px-6 sm:px-8 py-3.5 flex items-center gap-4">
                  <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?w=120&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" alt="Sarah L" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl object-cover border-2 border-white/60 shadow-sm" />
                  <span class="text-navy font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-wide">Sarah L</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-[0_4px_25px_rgba(0,0,0,0.07)] overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between border border-gray-100">
                <div class="p-7 sm:p-9"><p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">Their support helped me rebuild my life with dignity and hope. I am deeply grateful for the kindness and encouragement I received.</p></div>
                <div class="bg-[#76B2E1] px-6 sm:px-8 py-3.5 flex items-center gap-4">
                  <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544005313-94ddf0286df2?w=120&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" alt="Emily R" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl object-cover border-2 border-white/60 shadow-sm" />
                  <span class="text-navy font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-wide">Emily R</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-[0_4px_25px_rgba(0,0,0,0.07)] overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between border border-gray-100">
                <div class="p-7 sm:p-9"><p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">The compassion shown to my elderly mother gave our family strength and reassurance. We will always cherish their selfless service.</p></div>
